    "rate is an index, slowest first (TidalDeviceBoxAdapter.RateFractions): 0 1/1, 1 1/2, 2 1/3, 3 1/4, 4 3/16, 5 1/6, 6 1/8, 7 3/32, 8 1/12, 9 1/16, 10 3/64, 11 1/24, 12 1/32, 13 1/48, 14 1/64, 15 1/96, 16 1/128.",
    "depth 0..1 (how much); slope -1..1 (the shape: soft to choppy); symmetry 0..1; channelOffset in degrees (-180..180): 180 makes it an auto-pan, 0 a tremolo."
  ]
